  "description": "Web exchange-rate provider infrastructure for Bodu.Financial. Provides the WebRateProvider and PairWebRateProvider base classes that per-source provider packages (BoE, ECB, RBA, IMF, Yahoo, OFX, XE, OANDA, Fixer, exchangerate.host, FRED) build on, plus the shared fetch machinery: single-flight request coalescing, file-system response caching, HttpClient construction, and pair-load contracts. Depends only on Bodu.Financial and Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions.",
